  "reference" : "Surprisingly, when Prince Darling was angry, his ring seemed to press harder\ninto his finger.\nThe poor little dog, who didn't understand this at all, pulled Prince Darling's\ncoat to make him at least look at her, and this made the prince so cross that\nhe gave her a hard kick. Instantly his ring pricked him sharply, as though a pin\nstuck in his finger.\n\"I'm not making fun of you,\"\n\"You have made two mistakes. First, you were angry because you\ncould not meet your hunting goal in the forest.\nSecond, you were cruel to a poor\nlittle animal who did not in the least deserve to be ill-treated.",
